<title>FRANCE: Elf Gabon 1996 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Elf Gabon 1996 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income				   135.9  vs     84.3</p>
<p>    Dividend ($)				    30	   16.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Elf Gabon said in a statement that there would be a special dividend of about $75 per share due to the planned liquidation of CPIH in which Elf Gabon has a 65 percent stake.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
